{"data":{"body":"**[P2] This initialization failure still produces an `onInvocationEnd` without a matching `onInvocationStart`.** Completing `result` exceptionally triggers normal finalization, but `task.get()` never runs, so plugins may tear down stale state from a previous invocation. Track whether invocation-start dispatch occurred and gate end dispatch when it did not; add a full `execute()` test because the current `supplyHandler` test does not observe lifecycle hooks.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc768vNc","finding_digest":"f4bc4a00449a5914c95857a9a1eed99678dee5384f7edd7c070b0f331d38b8ab","finding_id":"arf_v1_6s6euacetjmrjskyk6u2d3wzsz","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::unpaired-invocation-end-on-mdc-capture-failure","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::unpaired-invocation-end-on-mdc-capture-failure","line":247,"observation_digest":"bdcc55dc4b642095b5c1541901e00b3c32ed79975e63e41e8ca7552df5d556c3","observation_id":"aro_v1_xxgflxclmqqjlnobkqmqdyalhq","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T17:59:35Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rargzwecfxebbedhb7eeq66fuw","reviewed_base_sha":"a521da02a2586439f6d200f7b1b0b98368d737df","reviewed_head_sha":"768fd0fd77d33b0834b192c981fbc298c0679953","reviewer":"codex","start_line":247,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_msrd2gobv554xrmjyyqhiyohno","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T17:59:35Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
